  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {Hint : } 6 \\cos ^3 \\theta+\\cos ^2 \\theta-1=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad(2 \\cos \\theta-1)\\left(3 \\cos ^2 \\theta+2 \\cos \\theta+1\\right)=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad \\cos \\theta=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(3 \\cos ^2 \\theta+2 \\cos \\theta+1 \\neq 0\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
